# Alpharael, Dreaming Acolyte: "When Alpharael enters, draw two cards. Then discard two cards unless you discard an artifact card." Bot1 draws Ornithopter and Island,
# so the artifact card is in hand only because the draw comes first. {1}{U}{B} is paid exactly by three Moxen (the pool is empty after). Taking the artifact option, an
# Island is not eligible (refusal beside the choice of the drawn Ornithopter). Only the Ornithopter goes.

